sh, five young friends enter a creepy murder house for a $25K dark web contest, only to end up in a brutal fight for their lives against a 7-foot-tall religious maniac with a sledgehammer who's out to kill all sinners.","releaseInfo":"2025","genres":["Horror","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"3.0"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI1L01lYWRvd2xhcmtzJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Meadowlarks","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/cjr2B9MMg6nF790QTy8p6G9bsk8.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jmANrjxSA54qfB2qf1BFyncRARb.jpg","description":"The film tells the story of four Cree siblings, Connie, Marianne, Gwen, and Anthony, separated as babies through Canada’s notorious Sixties Scoop, which saw indigenous children taken from their homes to be adopted by white families. Excited and curious, but also scared and afraid of rejection, they agree to meet for the first time over a holiday weekend in the mountains of Banff.","releaseInfo":"2025","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.0"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI1L01lZXQlMjBUaGUlMjBLaHVtYWxvcyUyMCUyODIwMjUlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Meet The Khumalos","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/3vWmsfJ8zf02mqcJbi6ofOnKECw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9PgmMBjbtEw4Q3ue94CRMxvIxXY.jpg","description":"Two moms — once best friends, now arch-enemies — start a neighborhood war against each other when they find out their kids are head-over-heels in love.","releaseInfo":"2025","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI1L01lcmdlJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Merge","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/96RRndTH4YPqYplAmnTT4hOW7MF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lEGHJBF7gwILj1MSJYDxNc4JcJy.jpg","description":"In a future where technology feels more human than